WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
<v Alex Chen>Thanks everyone for joining. Today I want us to align on the new customer self-service portal.</v>

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:12.000
<v Priya Rao>The main pain point is that customers call support to check invoice status. It's costing us a lot in call volume.</v>

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
<v Alex Chen>Right. If we let them see invoices themselves and pay online, we should cut support tickets and speed up cash collection.</v>

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
<v Sam Patel>What does success look like? I'd say a 30 percent drop in invoice-related tickets in the first quarter.</v>

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
<v Priya Rao>Agreed. And we need to make sure enterprise customers with multiple accounts can still be handled.</v>
